            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[NUPHY-RELEASE-NOTES 1
version:1.2.42
[zh-CN]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.42

• 修复仅框选、未说话时，语音识别的无语音结果阻止翻译、总结与解释的问题。
• 界面语言与本机语音识别语言独立；切换界面语言不再中止正在进行的语音操作。
• 语言选择中的“简体中文”始终保留中文名称。
[en]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.42

• Fix silent selections being blocked by a no-speech recognition result when translating, summarizing or explaining.
• Keep the interface language independent from local speech recognition; changing the interface language no longer cancels an active recording.
• Keep the Simplified Chinese option labeled in Chinese in language menus.
]]></description>
